===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|biochemistry|neuroscience|lang=en}} Any [[substance]], such as [[acetylcholine]] or [[dopamine]], responsible for sending [[nerve]] [[signal]]s across a [[synapse]] between two [[neuron]]s.

